oxasm
=====

oxasm is a port of OW2 ASM 9.10.1 (https://asm.ow2.io/, tag ASM_9_10_1) to Rust, and is
distributed under ASM's BSD-3-Clause license (see LICENSE).

  ASM: a very small and fast Java bytecode manipulation framework
